{x_bar
    {message
        output={@
The bar is a large, curving, glass circuit board.
There are a number of augmented programs behind it making drinks for various waiting customers.

        }
    }
}

{x_under_bar
    {message
        output={@
You look under the bar.
There is nothing there.

        }
    }
}

{x_bartender
    {message
        output={@
The bartenders are programs so they are translucent and lack identifiable
features.
Thin threads of light move through their bodies as they busily make cocktails
for waiting customers.

        }
    }
}















{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_bar))
    {act, logic=x_bar, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_under_bar))
    {act, logic=x_under_bar, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_bartender))
    {act, logic=x_bartender, tags=!_type|room }
}
